From: RenkuOS GPU Development <gpu-development@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:23:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] intel_extreme: calculate Dekel HDMI PLL register fields

---
 .../accelerants/intel_extreme/DekelHdmiPll.h  | 85 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../intel_extreme/DekelIntelLicense.txt       | 20 +++++
 2 files changed, 105 insertions(+)
